{"id":"becquerel","en":["becquerel","becquerel (Bq)"],"target":"bekerel","competitors":["becquerel"],"sense":"unit","senses":[{"id":"unit","gloss":"the SI unit of radioactivity, written in lower case (one becquerel, 10 becquerels), symbol Bq"},{"id":"person-name","gloss":"the surname Becquerel, capitalised: the scientist, his discovery or his work (Becquerel's experiment)"}]},
{"id":"node","en":["node"],"target":"nóða","competitors":["hnútur","núllpunktur"]},
